RI>What is a "Meta-Key"?  How does one use a command such as chat if they don't
RI>have a meta key?

If you have an Alt key on your keyboard, try it. I.e. M-c --> Alt-C.

If not, try M-c --> ESC c (first press&release ESC, then press c)

And if you can't find the Meta key, try # c.

